{"id":"grandioso","lemma":"grandioso","pos":"adj","rank":1331,"glosses":["great, grandiose"],"ipa":"/ɡɾanˈdjoso/","forms":{"feminine":"grandiosa","masculinePlural":"grandiosos","femininePlural":"grandiosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-grandioso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es grandioso.","en":"It's great.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/425206","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Quiero mostrarte algo grandioso.","en":"I want to show you something great.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to show","l":"mostrar"},{"g":"something, anything"},null]},{"text":"Nosotros los humanos tenemos una grandiosa manera de retorcer los hechos para adecuarlos a nuestra conclusión tan pronto hayamos hecho alguna.","en":"We humans have a great way of twisting facts to fit our conclusion as soon as we have made one.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"human","l":"humano"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"way"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to wring"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"done, completed","l":"hecho"},{"g":"for"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"conclusion, end"},null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"done, completed"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"}],"phrases":[[16,18,"no sooner"]]}]}